         <div type="commentary">
            <!--commentary encoded as per section §9.3 -->
            <p>I reproduce here the edition of Dr. Satyanarayana Rajaguru but it seems there is a lot of printed errors and so on... Moreover there is no mention of the place of preservation and I have no idea where I can find the copper plates to check his readings and produce a better edition. <bibl n="R"><ptr target="bib:Rajaguru2011_01"/></bibl> attributes this charter to the time of Yayāti the second.</p>
         </div>
